# EmailJS configuration — https://dashboard.emailjs.com/
# 1. Create a free EmailJS account, add an Email Service and an Email Template.
# 2. Copy .env.example to .env and paste your real values below.
# 3. Restart the dev server after changing .env.
#
# The in-app "Send Email" composer will stay disabled (with a helpful
# configuration notice) until these three values are provided.

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key
